    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Drop the Soap</strong> is a darkly humorous 2D platformer set in a brutal prison where you control a bar of soap trying not to fall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652910/extras/c108ddd2d2488a76273d25ae60324890.poster.avif?t=1748028103\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652910/extras/c108ddd2d2488a76273d25ae60324890.webm?t=1748028103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652910/extras/c108ddd2d2488a76273d25ae60324890.mp4?t=1748028103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by retro rage games and classic side-scrollers, this game offers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfc 25 unique, hand-designed prison-themed levels<br>\ud83d\udc80 Deadly traps, rolling enemies, and ghost guards<br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Fast-paced, relentless gameplay with precise controls<br>\ud83c\udfc6 Unlockable achievements for getting shot, scared, crushed, and flushed<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Original soundtrack (also available as DLC)<br>\ud83d\udcb8 Priced under <strong>$1.00</strong> \u2014 perfect for fans of cheap, fun, and challenging games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you like meme games, punishing platformers, or just want to laugh while repeatedly dying, <i>Don\u2019t Drop the Soap</i> delivers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652910/extras/c6e4a1bf9a2686be0976e687dfeb5457.avif?t=1748028103\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Drop the Soap</strong> is a darkly humorous 2D platformer set in a brutal prison where you control a bar of soap trying not to fall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652910/extras/c108ddd2d2488a76273d25ae60324890.poster.avif?t=1748028103\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652910/extras/c108ddd2d2488a76273d25ae60324890.webm?t=1748028103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652910/extras/c108ddd2d2488a76273d25ae60324890.mp4?t=1748028103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by retro rage games and classic side-scrollers, this game offers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfc 25 unique, hand-designed prison-themed levels<br>\ud83d\udc80 Deadly traps, rolling enemies, and ghost guards<br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Fast-paced, relentless gameplay with precise controls<br>\ud83c\udfc6 Unlockable achievements for getting shot, scared, crushed, and flushed<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Original soundtrack (also available as DLC)<br>\ud83d\udcb8 Priced under <strong>$1.00</strong> \u2014 perfect for fans of cheap, fun, and challenging games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you like meme games, punishing platformers, or just want to laugh while repeatedly dying, <i>Don\u2019t Drop the Soap</i> delivers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652910/extras/c6e4a1bf9a2686be0976e687dfeb5457.avif?t=1748028103\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A rage-fueled 2D platformer with dark humor. Play as a bar of soap escaping deadly traps, ghost guards, bullets, and prison floors. Fast, precise, and unforgiving. Packed with achievements. Cheap, weird, and brutally fun. Perfect for fans of indie, meme, and speedrun games.",
